hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1746","[AI-translation] Samura bin Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne ham se farmaya: Aaj raat merey paas do aaney waley aey aur wo mujhey uthaa kar ley gaey. To ham shehar mein pahunchey jo sonay ki eent aur chaandi ki eent se banaaya gaya tha. To hamaara isteqbaal aadmiyon ne kya jinkay aadhi khilqat goya sab se haseen hai jo tum dekhtey ho. Aur aadhi goya sab se qabeeh hai jo tum dekhtey ho. Unhon-ne un se kaha: Jao aur us nehar mein pado. To wo us mein padey. Phir hamaari taraf wapas aey jabke wo buraai un se door ho gai thi. To wo behtareen soorat mein ho gaey. Unhon-ne mujh se kaha: Ye Adan ki Jannat hai. Aur wo tumhaara thikaana hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Lekin wo qaum jinkay aadhi haseen thi aur aadhi qabeeh thi, beshak unhon-ne nek amal aur doosra bura milaa diya tha. Allah un se darguzar kar gaya. (Bukhari: 4674). Allah Taala ka qaul: (Aur uska Arsh paani par tha)."
